1
00:01:22,490 --> 00:01:25,760
Bang bang boom!

2
00:01:25,760 --> 00:01:29,000
Bang bang boom!

3
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:30,300
And—

4
00:01:30,300 --> 00:01:35,670
Nope

5
00:01:35,670 --> 00:01:37,310
Is Polka here? I'm here!

6
00:01:37,310 --> 00:01:40,950
Is everyone here?

7
00:01:40,950 --> 00:01:42,350
I'm here!

8
00:01:42,350 --> 00:01:44,050
You're a demon!

9
00:01:44,050 --> 00:01:48,590
So today is our 3rd Portal 2 session!

10
00:01:48,590 --> 00:01:50,270
Portal 2!

11
00:01:50,270 --> 00:01:52,370
We're in the middle of Portal 2!

12
00:01:52,370 --> 00:01:53,970
Portal 2, session 3!

13
00:01:53,970 --> 00:01:54,730
It's so fun, like—

14
00:01:54,730 --> 00:01:56,650
This is Portal 2, session 3!

15
00:01:56,650 --> 00:01:58,450
Yep, Portal 2, session 3!

16
00:01:58,450 --> 00:02:04,240
Is it small? Wait, is it still small? Hold on, hold on, whoa whoa whoa—

17
00:02:04,240 --> 00:02:08,790
Whoa whoa whoa, balance please!

18
00:02:08,790 --> 00:02:10,690
How is it?

19
00:02:10,690 --> 00:02:11,990
How does it look?

20
00:02:11,990 --> 00:02:18,590
High energy! Yeah, Pol's energy is high — it was high from the very first word!

21
00:02:18,590 --> 00:02:24,410
Today I'm properly hyped — it's your Omapol, Oma, Oma, Omapol Polka!

22
00:02:25,010 --> 00:02:27,010
Oh! Omapol Polka!

23
00:02:27,010 --> 00:02:28,730
What did you say?

24
00:02:28,730 --> 00:02:29,810
What did you just say?

25
00:02:29,810 --> 00:02:31,870
It's Omapol Polka!

26
00:02:31,870 --> 00:02:34,670
It's Omapol Polka!

27
00:02:34,670 --> 00:02:37,050
This side is fine!

28
00:02:37,050 --> 00:02:37,890
Are you okay?

29
00:02:37,890 --> 00:02:41,990
Hey everyone, how's the volume on my end?

30
00:02:41,990 --> 00:02:44,150
Where is the portal gun thing?

31
00:02:44,150 --> 00:02:46,450
It's in the next area!

32
00:02:46,450 --> 00:02:50,130
How did we get in again?

33
00:02:50,130 --> 00:02:52,110
OK, got it, roger!

34
00:02:52,110 --> 00:02:53,010
Roger, roger roger roger!

35
00:02:53,010 --> 00:02:54,450
Still small? Pol?

36
00:02:54,450 --> 00:02:55,250
Gyoiin gyoiin~

37
00:02:55,250 --> 00:02:57,730
Oh, they're saying Polka looks small.

38
00:02:57,730 --> 00:02:59,690
It's been a hot topic lately!

39
00:02:59,690 --> 00:03:01,740
It really has, hasn't it!

40
00:03:01,740 --> 00:03:04,490
Okay, so, Pol—

41
00:03:04,490 --> 00:03:07,050
Are we on 4? 5?

42
00:03:07,050 --> 00:03:07,450
6?

43
00:03:07,450 --> 00:03:11,170
How do we even get to 6?

44
00:03:11,170 --> 00:03:13,290
Wait, where's 6?

45
00:03:13,290 --> 00:03:15,850
Hmm, how did we do it last time?

46
00:03:15,850 --> 00:03:18,010
Where's Pol?

47
00:03:18,010 --> 00:03:19,010
How do we do it?

48
00:03:19,010 --> 00:03:20,170
Heave-ho!

49
00:03:20,170 --> 00:03:21,090
Can we make it?

50
00:03:21,090 --> 00:03:23,010
Heave-ho, heave-ho!

51
00:03:23,010 --> 00:03:27,190
Hmm, I feel like it might be that thing, maybe...

52
00:03:27,190 --> 00:03:31,020
Where?!

53
00:03:31,020 --> 00:03:33,540
Balance of the flow... hah hah hah hah hah hah

54
00:03:33,540 --> 00:03:34,320
Is this about right?

55
00:03:34,320 --> 00:03:37,080
Did we fall somewhere around here before?

56
00:03:37,080 --> 00:03:40,260
Yeah, wasn't the way to get here the same as for 3?

57
00:03:40,260 --> 00:03:43,840
The blue dots from earlier — the blue dots!

58
00:03:43,840 --> 00:03:44,660
It's here, right?

59
00:03:44,660 --> 00:03:46,740
Blue dots?

60
00:03:46,740 --> 00:03:48,760
Oh no, I've already forgotten how this game works...

61
00:03:48,760 --> 00:03:51,760
That's fast?! The left and right buttons open different portals!

62
00:03:51,760 --> 00:03:55,760
No way, that's just the normal thing!

63
00:03:55,760 --> 00:04:01,560
Where? Where? Where?

64
00:04:01,560 --> 00:04:06,630
5? It's not 5, right? It's 6, right?

65
00:04:06,630 --> 00:04:09,430
Where is 6 in this?

66
00:04:09,430 --> 00:04:12,030
2!

67
00:04:12,030 --> 00:04:14,830
There's only 2 and 3!

68
00:04:17,830 --> 00:04:21,630
Look carefully — above Polka!

69
00:04:21,630 --> 00:04:23,630
Wait, is it 5 not 6?

70
00:04:23,630 --> 00:04:25,630
Huh, didn't we start from 6 today?

71
00:04:25,630 --> 00:04:30,630
It's 5! We were in the middle of 5 and then it was like, time to sleep!

72
00:04:30,630 --> 00:04:34,430
Were we in the middle of 5?

73
00:04:34,430 --> 00:04:39,430
Oh, you're right — there are only 3 marks filled in!

74
00:04:39,430 --> 00:04:43,360
So how do we get over there?

75
00:04:43,360 --> 00:04:47,470
You jump on that springy pad thing and launch yourself!

76
00:04:47,470 --> 00:04:50,550
To jump over there—

77
00:04:50,550 --> 00:04:55,210
You shoot a portal on that upper-left surface and use it to fling yourself over!

78
00:04:55,210 --> 00:04:56,990
I can't get in here!

79
00:04:56,990 --> 00:05:01,170
Here and... over there, maybe?

80
00:05:01,170 --> 00:05:02,110
What is this?

81
00:05:02,110 --> 00:05:03,270
Wait, that's wrong.

82
00:05:03,270 --> 00:05:04,270
Like this?

83
00:05:04,270 --> 00:05:05,290
Like this.

84
00:05:05,290 --> 00:05:07,670
Huh?

85
00:05:07,670 --> 00:05:08,630
That one.

86
00:05:08,630 --> 00:05:10,530
It went the opposite way.

87
00:05:10,530 --> 00:05:14,330
It keeps going over there?

88
00:05:14,330 --> 00:05:17,330
Overwrite the one that's open!

89
00:05:17,330 --> 00:05:21,130
Overwrite? Wait, maybe it's not this way?

90
00:05:21,130 --> 00:05:22,130
Yeah, exactly.

91
00:05:22,130 --> 00:05:25,130
Whaaaat?

92
00:05:25,130 --> 00:05:27,930
Now we can't get back.

93
00:05:27,930 --> 00:05:29,930
That's not true at all.

94
00:05:29,930 --> 00:05:33,730
Hmm, Luna-tan's got yellow and red, right?

95
00:05:33,730 --> 00:05:35,730
Is it over there?

96
00:05:35,730 --> 00:05:37,530
Here and here.

97
00:05:37,530 --> 00:05:38,330
Hm?

98
00:05:38,330 --> 00:05:40,130
You mean here and here?

99
00:05:40,130 --> 00:05:42,930
Yes! We finally made it!

100
00:05:42,930 --> 00:05:44,730
Good work!

101
00:05:44,730 --> 00:05:47,530
Now that we're through, let me turn on the AC.

102
00:05:47,530 --> 00:05:48,530
Sure.

103
00:05:48,530 --> 00:05:52,610
It's hot, it's already that time of year.

104
00:05:52,610 --> 00:05:54,410
For real.

105
00:05:54,410 --> 00:05:57,260
Oh, it says 4.

106
00:05:57,260 --> 00:05:59,060
What does?

107
00:05:59,060 --> 00:06:02,660
The next course.

108
00:06:02,660 --> 00:06:05,460
Course 5, 04.

109
00:06:06,950 --> 00:06:08,880
Where's my partner?

110
00:06:08,880 --> 00:06:10,550
Huh? You're already here?

111
00:06:10,550 --> 00:06:12,350
Huh? Wait, what? Huh?

112
00:06:12,350 --> 00:06:13,170
I'm here!

113
00:06:13,170 --> 00:06:14,950
Huh? Isn't it here?

114
00:06:14,950 --> 00:06:15,950
Hold on, this one—

115
00:06:15,950 --> 00:06:16,950
Oh, yes yes yes, that's right!

116
00:06:16,950 --> 00:06:18,950
You were still over there, huh.

117
00:06:18,950 --> 00:06:21,750
It's getting confusing, isn't it.

118
00:06:21,750 --> 00:06:23,550
Oh, it's here.

119
00:06:23,550 --> 00:06:25,350
Huh? What about you—

120
00:06:25,350 --> 00:06:27,350
Oh, did you turn orange?

121
00:06:27,350 --> 00:06:56,620
Ohhhhh~!

122
00:06:56,620 --> 00:06:57,480
This one.

123
00:06:57,480 --> 00:06:59,580
It didn't say 4.

124
00:06:59,580 --> 00:07:00,780
Are we actually at 4?

125
00:07:00,780 --> 00:07:02,180
Wait, isn't this that thing?

126
00:07:02,180 --> 00:07:04,180
It says 4 right there, look.

127
00:07:04,180 --> 00:07:05,180
Is this really 4?

128
00:07:05,180 --> 00:07:06,980
Zero.

129
00:07:06,980 --> 00:07:08,680
It says 4, see?

130
00:07:08,680 --> 00:07:11,180
Propulsion Gel, 04.

131
00:07:11,180 --> 00:07:12,180
Oh, it is 4.

132
00:07:12,180 --> 00:07:15,480
Wow, this one really messes with your head.

133
00:07:15,480 --> 00:07:18,880
The gel pressure is crazy — how do you do this again?

134
00:07:18,880 --> 00:07:19,880
Here?

135
00:07:19,880 --> 00:07:22,180
I think you shoot the gel somewhere, right?

136
00:07:22,180 --> 00:07:24,180
Probably, yeah. Oh ho~

137
00:07:24,540 --> 00:07:29,380
Hmm, which spots do we need to connect with the gel?

138
00:07:29,380 --> 00:07:34,280
Looks like everything connects somewhere. Oh wait, what was this again — you can jump with it?

139
00:07:34,280 --> 00:07:38,880
Jump with the gel and go boing boing — oh wow, it's actually bouncy!

140
00:07:38,880 --> 00:07:44,680
Doesn't it look like it's telling you to go up? Oh, it might turn into like a wall-jump thing.

141
00:07:44,680 --> 00:07:52,460
Ugh, I'm bad at that — oh no, oh no, oh no, oops! Oh wait, maybe that's fine? Boing boing, that's amazing!

142
00:07:52,460 --> 00:07:56,960
It's like some tower game where the color just keeps spreading everywhere.

143
00:07:56,960 --> 00:07:59,880
Ugh, I'm bad at this, I messed up~

144
00:07:59,880 --> 00:08:02,680
Looks like we'll need to kick off the walls.

145
00:08:02,680 --> 00:08:07,480
It never covers the spots you actually want it to cover.

146
00:08:07,480 --> 00:08:10,460
This one?

147
00:08:10,460 --> 00:08:13,260
For now let's just coat every surface we can.

148
00:08:13,260 --> 00:08:16,060
Okay, went there!

149
00:08:16,060 --> 00:08:18,940
Here we go!

150
00:08:18,940 --> 00:08:20,740
Where next?

151
00:08:20,740 --> 00:08:22,740
Stop jumping so much.

152
00:08:22,740 --> 00:08:26,340
Heave-ho.

153
00:08:26,340 --> 00:08:28,140
Here... I can't get in.

154
00:08:28,140 --> 00:08:29,940
Can't get in.

155
00:08:29,940 --> 00:08:31,940
Wait, I can't get in!

156
00:08:31,940 --> 00:08:33,740
What is this?

157
00:08:33,740 --> 00:08:36,540
Doesn't seem like this is the right spot.

158
00:08:36,540 --> 00:08:38,140
That startled me.

159
00:08:38,140 --> 00:08:40,140
Then where do I put this?

160
00:08:40,140 --> 00:08:43,940
Over here? Wait, you can't shoot here.

161
00:08:45,920 --> 00:08:51,320
Since it doesn't come out here, I think this spot is right.

162
00:08:51,320 --> 00:08:57,740
So that means we can go through here?

163
00:08:57,740 --> 00:09:00,720
What about up top? Oh, we can go up!

164
00:09:00,720 --> 00:09:04,520
Alright, I've painted all the surfaces we can get wet!

165
00:09:04,520 --> 00:09:05,820
Nice!

166
00:09:05,820 --> 00:09:10,050
Ideally I'd want to go boing boing boing like this.

167
00:09:10,050 --> 00:09:11,320
I feel like it'll work.

168
00:09:11,320 --> 00:09:15,760
But we're missing the starting point, aren't we?

169
00:09:15,760 --> 00:09:19,760
Oh wait, maybe we fall from above down to here?

170
00:09:19,760 --> 00:09:23,660
Oh, is that how it works?

171
00:09:23,660 --> 00:09:28,480
Hmm, but what's that thing at the bottom?

172
00:09:28,480 --> 00:09:31,420
So we go boing boing with this...

173
00:09:31,420 --> 00:09:32,280
Whoa!

174
00:09:32,280 --> 00:09:35,100
That wasn't it.

175
00:09:35,100 --> 00:09:41,060
I think we fall from above and launch off the yellow one.

176
00:09:41,060 --> 00:09:44,480
This blue one is all bubbly.

177
00:09:44,480 --> 00:09:46,060
How do you do the arrow thing?

178
00:09:46,060 --> 00:09:46,610
Oh no!

179
00:09:46,610 --> 00:09:48,100
I pressed it!

180
00:09:48,100 --> 00:09:49,740
Is it F?

181
00:09:49,740 --> 00:09:51,820
Yes, yes, yes, that's it!

182
00:09:51,820 --> 00:09:53,380
So how do you press it?

183
00:09:53,380 --> 00:09:55,600
It's F.

184
00:09:55,600 --> 00:09:59,920
You press F — it's F!

185
00:09:59,920 --> 00:10:01,100
F, huh.

186
00:10:01,100 --> 00:10:02,540
Pah! Pah! Here!

187
00:10:02,540 --> 00:10:04,180
Pah! Pah! Pah!

188
00:10:04,180 --> 00:10:05,140
It changed from "Po" to something else lol

189
00:10:05,140 --> 00:10:06,440
"Po" "Po" "Po" — it's right here!

190
00:10:06,440 --> 00:10:07,540
Did it become "Pa"?

191
00:10:07,540 --> 00:10:10,000
Try pressing "Pa" here and here.

192
00:10:10,000 --> 00:10:12,320
"Pa" here and here?

193
00:10:12,320 --> 00:10:13,640
Yeah, the "Po" "Po" ones—

194
00:10:13,640 --> 00:10:15,760
Huh? Huh? Huh?

195
00:10:15,760 --> 00:10:17,620
Here and here.

196
00:10:17,620 --> 00:10:18,820
OK! YES!

197
00:10:18,820 --> 00:10:23,620
And then Luna-tan puts them here and here—

198
00:10:23,620 --> 00:10:24,500
Go!

199
00:10:24,500 --> 00:10:25,420
Go!

200
00:10:25,420 --> 00:10:27,300
Go!

201
00:10:27,300 --> 00:10:28,910
Into the hole!

202
00:10:28,910 --> 00:10:57,460
Wooooo!

203
00:10:57,460 --> 00:11:26,260
Yes yes yes!

204
00:11:26,260 --> 00:11:29,040
But next time, that ink thing and stuff...

205
00:11:29,040 --> 00:11:32,000
Ah, we did something like this before, didn't we.

206
00:11:32,000 --> 00:11:35,540
Oh right, there was this.

207
00:11:35,540 --> 00:11:37,900
What did we do with this again?

208
00:11:37,900 --> 00:11:41,600
There's a button here.

209
00:11:41,600 --> 00:11:43,680
What is it?

210
00:11:43,680 --> 00:11:47,640
What's the button for?

211
00:11:47,640 --> 00:11:50,120
I can't press this either.

212
00:11:50,120 --> 00:11:51,960
You can press it, just press it!

213
00:11:51,960 --> 00:11:52,980
Ah, ah, ah!

214
00:11:52,980 --> 00:11:54,180
There's ink over there!

215
00:11:54,180 --> 00:11:55,980
Huh?

216
00:11:55,980 --> 00:11:57,780
That's so far away...

217
00:11:57,780 --> 00:11:59,780
Wait, will it carry the ink over?

218
00:11:59,780 --> 00:12:01,580
But also this—

219
00:12:01,580 --> 00:12:03,580
There's a wall there so it won't work.

220
00:12:03,580 --> 00:12:05,580
Oh wait, never mind!

221
00:12:05,580 --> 00:12:07,180
I'm going!

222
00:12:07,180 --> 00:12:09,180
Can you make it?

223
00:12:09,180 --> 00:12:11,180
Huh? Did you fall? Oh, that didn't work.

224
00:12:11,180 --> 00:12:13,180
Right, the one who placed the wall can't go through.

225
00:12:13,180 --> 00:12:15,180
Oh yeah, that's right.

226
00:12:15,180 --> 00:12:17,180
Which one did you just place?

227
00:12:17,180 --> 00:12:19,180
Oh, you shot it through here?

228
00:12:22,630 --> 00:12:24,430
Should you be the one to do it?

229
00:12:24,430 --> 00:12:25,230
Want to swap roles?

230
00:12:25,230 --> 00:12:26,230
Just one drop.

231
00:12:26,230 --> 00:12:27,030
Okay.

232
00:12:27,030 --> 00:12:28,030
Alright then—

233
00:12:28,030 --> 00:12:31,030
Let me see how it moves.

234
00:12:31,030 --> 00:12:34,030
Heave-ho, heave-ho, heave-ho.

235
00:12:34,030 --> 00:12:34,830
Huh?

236
00:12:34,830 --> 00:12:36,830
I ran right into it.

237
00:12:36,830 --> 00:12:39,520
The grate—

238
00:12:39,520 --> 00:12:43,250
This is... oh, but there's something up top.

239
00:12:43,250 --> 00:12:46,100
There's something above, but—

240
00:12:46,100 --> 00:12:49,910
So what does that mean?

241
00:12:49,910 --> 00:12:53,870
What happened to these powers?

242
00:12:53,870 --> 00:12:56,670
How do we get through this?

243
00:12:56,670 --> 00:12:58,670
It's definitely up there

244
00:12:58,670 --> 00:13:05,700
Pressing the button doesn't change anything, right?

245
00:13:05,700 --> 00:13:08,500
Even if you press the button...

246
00:13:08,500 --> 00:13:11,300
The gel...

247
00:13:11,300 --> 00:13:12,900
Over there...

248
00:13:12,900 --> 00:13:13,900
This gel...

249
00:13:13,900 --> 00:13:15,870
Can you shoot from there?

250
00:13:15,870 --> 00:13:16,700
Maybe!

251
00:13:16,700 --> 00:13:19,700
Yeah, you did it! Nice! Where do we put it?

252
00:13:19,700 --> 00:13:21,700
From here — where do we even put this?

253
00:13:21,700 --> 00:13:23,700
Can't you only shoot it up onto that surface?

254
00:13:23,700 --> 00:13:25,700
I think once that ring comes out...

255
00:13:25,700 --> 00:13:27,500
Okay, let's press it — point!

256
00:13:27,500 --> 00:13:33,100
Wait, did the wall get coated?

257
00:13:33,100 --> 00:13:34,900
One more, one more — let's do the other launcher too!

258
00:13:34,900 --> 00:13:35,900
Okay, one more — here we go

259
00:13:35,900 --> 00:13:37,700
Pressing it!

260
00:13:37,700 --> 00:13:39,500
Come on, come here!

261
00:13:39,500 --> 00:13:41,300
Is this thing tilted?

262
00:13:41,300 --> 00:13:43,100
Will that one fly too?

263
00:13:43,950 --> 00:13:47,580
Do we just jump to the wall?

264
00:13:47,580 --> 00:13:50,500
Right? What are we supposed to do?

265
00:13:50,500 --> 00:13:52,500
Scary scary scary scary!

266
00:13:52,500 --> 00:14:00,820
Wait, does this one need a bit of skill?

267
00:14:00,820 --> 00:14:03,820
Hmm, I see...

268
00:14:03,820 --> 00:14:05,620
Didn't go straight...

269
00:14:05,620 --> 00:14:09,620
Needs a little skill, huh — it's angled after all

270
00:14:09,620 --> 00:14:11,820
Is this thing tilted?

271
00:14:11,820 --> 00:14:15,620
Yeah, just a bit — see, it's not parallel. Not parallel. Oh, can we make it?

272
00:14:15,620 --> 00:14:19,620
It feels parallel to me though... just a little more. You mean you keep slipping?

273
00:14:19,620 --> 00:14:23,620
Getting good good good good good good good good good good good good good good good good good!

274
00:14:23,620 --> 00:14:28,420
