1862
01:43:46,600 --> 01:43:52,680
If we do it like this, the path forms — but then it disappears again.

1863
01:43:52,680 --> 01:43:55,560
Hmm, this is...

1864
01:43:55,560 --> 01:44:00,770
Reversed.

1865
01:44:00,770 --> 01:44:07,870
If we do it like this, it'll end up like this.

1866
01:44:07,870 --> 01:44:14,070
