1867
01:44:14,070 --> 01:44:19,020
Gel onto myself.

1868
01:44:19,260 --> 01:44:23,310
What if we do it like this?

1869
01:44:23,310 --> 01:44:29,050
What does it even mean to "direct the gel"? Luna's water-repellent coating is too strong.

1870
01:44:29,050 --> 01:44:34,810
Water-repellent treatment. Luna's got water-repellent coating on her, doesn't she.

1871
01:44:34,810 --> 01:44:40,370
Wave?

1872
01:44:40,370 --> 01:44:44,550
How are you supposed to do a wave while shooting gel?

1873
01:44:44,550 --> 01:44:48,830
Oh wait, can you jump here?

1874
01:44:48,830 --> 01:44:53,630
Yeah — oh wait, a turret's watching you right now!

1875
01:44:53,630 --> 01:44:56,250
That turret's watching you, doing that!

1876
01:44:56,250 --> 01:45:05,310
