1877
01:45:05,310 --> 01:45:09,950
Point it toward the turret.

1878
01:45:09,950 --> 01:45:11,950
Hey Luna, this thing here.

1879
01:45:11,950 --> 01:45:19,930
There's this here, right? From here, gel. Gel here? This — splat splat.

1880
01:45:19,930 --> 01:45:29,850
Normally you can't transport through it because of this shield. The gel is on the inside here.

1881
01:45:29,850 --> 01:45:35,710
But then, the portal—

1882
01:45:35,710 --> 01:45:38,710
Oh, but the portal's fine.

1883
01:45:39,830 --> 01:45:42,730
The portal here and—

1884
01:45:42,730 --> 01:45:46,330
Wait, can't we place a portal here?

1885
01:45:46,330 --> 01:45:48,130
Where can't we place a portal?

1886
01:45:48,130 --> 01:45:48,970
Hold on.

1887
01:45:48,970 --> 01:45:52,530
Gel at the portal spot—

1888
01:45:52,530 --> 01:45:54,230
Places we can put gel are here and—

1889
01:45:54,230 --> 01:46:01,290
