The button! Quick!

2122
02:00:25,310 --> 02:00:27,910
Quick!

2123
02:00:27,910 --> 02:00:28,910
Whoa!

2124
02:00:28,910 --> 02:00:30,710
Whoa! My head came off!

2125
02:00:30,710 --> 02:00:34,710
See!

2126
02:00:34,710 --> 02:00:37,360
Huh? What?

2127
02:00:37,360 --> 02:00:38,160
Huh?

2128
02:00:38,160 --> 02:00:38,960
With this...

2129
02:00:38,960 --> 02:00:40,960
What? Did a cutscene start or something?

2130
02:00:40,960 --> 02:00:41,960
Suddenly a cutscene

2131
02:00:41,960 --> 02:00:42,770
I dunno

2132
02:00:42,770 --> 02:00:44,760
I've never seen this cutscene before

2133
02:00:44,760 --> 02:00:45,560
This was in the game?

2134
02:00:45,560 --> 02:00:47,560
There was a cutscene?!

2135
02:00:47,560 --> 02:00:49,360
That's so cool

2136
02:00:50,160 --> 02:00:52,100
What is this?

2137
02:00:52,100 --> 02:00:55,760
Wait, what does it mean that the emote sound matched?

2138
02:00:55,760 --> 02:00:57,660
That was kinda cool

2139
02:00:57,660 --> 02:01:00,460
It's like we're fighting the final boss now

2140
02:01:00,460 --> 02:01:03,160
What is this, Toy Story?

2141
02:01:03,160 --> 02:01:06,960
Whoa~

2142
02:01:06,960 --> 02:01:09,820
I can hear like, big stage lighting sounds

2143
02:01:09,820 --> 02:01:12,560
What's out there?

2144
02:01:22,020 --> 02:01:24,020
What, what — what are we looking for? I'm ahead of you.

2145
02:01:24,020 --> 02:01:29,120
Seriously... huh? Wh— there's something there!

2146
02:01:29,120 --> 02:01:30,420
Huh? A human?!

2147
02:01:30,420 --> 02:01:34,420
What, what, what?! Scary scary scary! Wait, for real? What is this?

2148
02:01:34,420 --> 02:01:36,420
No no no! A human!

2149
02:01:36,420 --> 02:01:42,700
Whaaaat! That's way too much! Wait — is this The Matrix? What is this? So scary!

2150
02:01:42,700 --> 02:01:49,140
Huh? Even the robots are going all floaty. "Savior"...? What is this? What are they saying?

2151
02:01:49,140 --> 02:02:05,600
Let's dance! Whoa! The drums are so hype! I don't really get it but let's dance! They're happy there's a human. We're the saviors...? Huh? Oh yeah! The usual.

2152
02:02:05,600 --> 02:02:07,480
The usual thing

2153
02:02:07,480 --> 02:02:09,640
Wait, who is this human?

2154
02:02:09,640 --> 02:02:11,420
So this takes us to the next stage?

2155
02:02:11,420 --> 02:02:13,680
I see

2156
02:02:13,680 --> 02:02:15,400
The robots are totally weirded out

2157
02:02:15,400 --> 02:02:19,140
We always get blown up and sent to the next stage

2158
02:02:19,140 --> 02:02:24,440
Science has been saved

2159
02:02:24,440 --> 02:02:27,440
Wait, what is this?

2160
02:02:27,440 --> 02:02:28,980
What's this called?

2161
02:02:28,980 --> 02:02:31,180
Can't do teamwork

2162
02:02:31,180 --> 02:02:32,340
Shut up

2163
02:02:32,340 --> 02:02:33,540
What's that?

2164
02:02:33,540 --> 02:02:35,540
What's with these people?

2165
02:02:35,540 --> 02:02:37,540
Extremely poor interpersonal skills

2166
02:02:37,540 --> 02:02:39,540
What are they saying?

2167
02:02:39,540 --> 02:02:43,940
What?

2168
02:02:43,940 --> 02:02:47,540
Everyone has a name

2169
02:02:47,540 --> 02:02:49,540
Possessive to the core

2170
02:02:49,540 --> 02:02:51,340
Did we clear it?

2171
02:02:51,340 --> 02:02:53,140
What is this?

2172
02:02:53,140 --> 02:02:55,140
Is this the ending?

2173
02:02:55,140 --> 02:02:57,140
There's more, right?

2174
02:02:57,140 --> 02:02:58,940
There should be more, no?

2175
02:02:58,940 --> 02:03:00,740
Are we being roasted?

2176
02:03:00,740 --> 02:03:02,740
What is this? What's going on?

2177
02:03:02,740 --> 02:03:04,740
About time... shut up already!

2178
02:03:04,740 --> 02:03:13,190
What is this? Are they naming each person one by one?

2179
02:03:13,190 --> 02:03:17,200
For humans...

2180
02:03:17,200 --> 02:03:19,240
Huh?

2181
02:03:19,240 --> 02:03:22,040
What kind of story is this?

2182
02:03:22,040 --> 02:03:25,940
Whoa?

2183
02:03:25,940 --> 02:03:29,740
Wait, is this the staff roll? No way!

2184
02:03:32,770 --> 02:03:40,170
Wha— wha— wha—? Huh? What happened? Monday.

2185
02:03:40,170 --> 02:03:46,450
Hates their job.

2186
02:03:46,450 --> 02:03:52,890
Baffling.

2187
02:03:52,890 --> 02:03:58,270
Chronic latecomer. Shut up!

2188
02:03:58,270 --> 02:04:02,090
Wait, is this about Polka?

2189
02:04:02,090 --> 02:04:05,290
"Used to be a chronic offender" "Always in a bad mood"

2190
02:04:05,290 --> 02:04:07,190
"Wow, that's not right at all"

2191
02:04:07,190 --> 02:04:13,330
"Nothing but trash talk" "Way too self-conscious!"

2192
02:04:13,330 --> 02:04:17,630
"Well, I guess not" "Why is Polka the one answering?"

2193
02:04:17,630 --> 02:04:22,230
"Moody" "Moody" But what about Luna? Moody?

2194
02:04:22,230 --> 02:04:24,670
"Yeah, maybe a little moody"

2195
02:04:24,670 --> 02:04:29,740
"Afraid of connecting with others" "Some days are like that"

2196
02:04:29,740 --> 02:04:32,730
Extremely afraid of conflict

2197
02:04:32,730 --> 02:04:34,730
I just want to say let's stop

2198
02:04:34,730 --> 02:04:35,730
Constantly anxious

2199
02:04:35,730 --> 02:04:39,730
What is this, like a psych test you'd have to take at one of those clinics?

2200
02:04:39,730 --> 02:04:40,730
Aggressive

2201
02:04:40,730 --> 02:04:41,530
That's my type

2202
02:04:41,530 --> 02:04:43,530
Shut up, nobody asked for that

2203
02:04:43,530 --> 02:04:45,530
That's subjective

2204
02:04:45,530 --> 02:04:46,530
Cowardly

2205
02:04:46,530 --> 02:04:51,100
What the heck

2206
02:04:51,100 --> 02:04:54,900
Takes pleasure in others' misfortune

2207
02:04:59,700 --> 02:05:01,680
So many negative words keep coming up

2208
02:05:01,680 --> 02:05:03,720
Lacks self-confidence

2209
02:05:03,720 --> 02:05:08,940
Underestimates their own workload

2210
02:05:08,940 --> 02:05:10,180
That's everyone

2211
02:05:10,180 --> 02:05:15,490
Mouths words while reading

2212
02:05:15,490 --> 02:05:19,790
My mouth is always moving

2213
02:05:19,790 --> 02:05:20,670
Can't read

2214
02:05:20,670 --> 02:05:21,250
Can't read

2215
02:05:21,250 --> 02:05:22,690
What do you mean "can't read"?

2216
02:05:22,690 --> 02:05:23,510
First of all, can't read

2217
02:05:23,510 --> 02:05:27,850
After "mouths words while reading," what's with "can't read"?

2218
02:05:28,070 --> 02:05:29,670
No empathy

2219
02:05:29,670 --> 02:05:33,540
What's this one?

2220
02:05:33,540 --> 02:05:35,030
Seriously?

2221
02:05:35,030 --> 02:05:35,630
Is this for real?

2222
02:05:35,630 --> 02:05:36,830
Cheating manners!

2223
02:05:36,830 --> 02:05:38,930
Is this the ending credits?

2224
02:05:38,930 --> 02:05:40,230
I have no idea

2225
02:05:40,230 --> 02:05:40,830
Is that what this is?

2226
02:05:40,830 --> 02:05:42,630
But these are people's names, right?

2227
02:05:42,630 --> 02:05:43,830
Is it Oliver?

2228
02:05:43,830 --> 02:05:44,930
Yeah, yeah

2229
02:05:44,930 --> 02:05:47,830
Steals food from the shared fridge

2230
02:05:47,830 --> 02:05:50,230
These words just keep coming, huh

2231
02:05:50,230 --> 02:05:52,100
Someone like that should change their name

2232
02:05:52,100 --> 02:05:54,630
There's an Ueno-san

2233
02:05:54,630 --> 02:05:56,130
Perfectionist

2234
02:05:56,130 --> 02:05:57,750
-What's wrong with that? -What's wrong with that?

2235
02:05:57,750 --> 02:05:58,570
Ehhhh?

2236
02:05:58,570 --> 02:06:03,890
Wait, so are Polka and the others done now?

2237
02:06:03,890 --> 02:06:05,770
Worrywart

2238
02:06:05,770 --> 02:06:07,210
-Wait -Is it over?

2239
02:06:07,210 --> 02:06:10,270
After-credits stuff is coming, hold on

2240
02:06:10,270 --> 02:06:11,610
Hey, what about us?

2241
02:06:11,610 --> 02:06:13,590
Is it over? This game?

2242
02:06:13,590 --> 02:06:17,110
Maybe it doesn't go all the way to chapter 9 after all

2243
02:06:17,110 --> 02:06:22,410
Wow, this is my first time seeing end credits like this

2244
02:06:22,410 --> 02:06:24,410
It doesn't feel like the game is over

2245
02:06:24,730 --> 02:06:26,510
Ignoring the work we're supposed to be doing right now

2246
02:06:26,510 --> 02:06:28,370
I'm laughing but like...

2247
02:06:28,370 --> 02:06:32,090
There are so many staff members!

2248
02:06:32,090 --> 02:06:38,710
Story-wise, because of us two, the remaining humans who were hiding got found by this guy...

2249
02:06:38,710 --> 02:06:40,890
And now they're going to be used as test subjects. That's the worst!

2250
02:06:40,890 --> 02:06:46,250
Not yet, I think

2251
02:06:46,250 --> 02:06:50,090
The people from before are showing up in live-action too. Amazing!

2252
02:06:50,090 --> 02:06:52,810
What is this?

2253
02:06:53,090 --> 02:06:54,950
Voice? Voice acting?

2254
02:06:54,950 --> 02:06:56,890
It says "Voice" here

2255
02:06:56,890 --> 02:07:00,610
This person was talking the whole time though

2256
02:07:00,610 --> 02:07:03,410
Wait, is this really the end credits?

2257
02:07:03,410 --> 02:07:07,330
They're showing up in human form properly

2258
02:07:07,330 --> 02:07:08,950
Whoa~

2259
02:07:08,950 --> 02:07:12,910
Well, if you want to know the full story, you'd have to play Portal, right

2260
02:07:12,910 --> 02:07:17,910
This is the co-op mode after all — it's still Portal though

2261
02:07:17,910 --> 02:07:19,690
Are they connected?

2262
02:07:19,690 --> 02:07:23,650
It's possible this is all connected

2263
02:07:23,650 --> 02:07:25,410
Oh really?

2264
02:07:25,410 --> 02:07:26,130
I dunno

2265
02:07:26,130 --> 02:07:30,030
What's the main story? What is it?

2266
02:07:30,030 --> 02:07:32,050
Isn't this the main story? Portal 2?

2267
02:07:32,050 --> 02:07:37,990
This is Portal 2's co-op mode

2268
02:07:37,990 --> 02:07:40,870
So you have to play it solo? This?

2269
02:07:40,870 --> 02:07:43,870
Can't you do the main story with two people?

2270
02:07:43,870 --> 02:07:45,870
Right, you can't do it with two people

2271
02:07:45,870 --> 02:07:47,470
Oh, so that's why...

2272
02:07:47,470 --> 02:07:53,510
Thank you for participating in this...

2273
02:07:53,510 --> 02:07:57,650
Something about wiping your hair...

2274
02:07:57,650 --> 02:07:59,910
Oh, so that's how it is

2275
02:07:59,910 --> 02:08:03,630
We finished without understanding anything, didn't we

2276
02:08:03,630 --> 02:08:09,430
The whole time it felt like study sessions and getting closer with Luna

2277
02:08:09,430 --> 02:08:10,450
Yeah

2278
02:08:10,450 --> 02:08:11,570
Just puzzle-solving

2279
02:08:11,570 --> 02:08:12,830
Wait, it's not ending

2280
02:08:12,830 --> 02:08:13,390
It's not ending?

2281
02:08:13,390 --> 02:08:13,970
But the answer to that is...

2282
02:08:13,970 --> 02:08:15,250
We're back

2283
02:08:15,250 --> 02:08:20,890
We cleared all the test courses. Thank you very much.

2284
02:08:20,890 --> 02:08:24,790
It's over! Is it over? Is it really over?

2285
02:08:24,790 --> 02:08:31,390
467 co-op points. I don't know if that's a lot or a little. It got brighter in here.

2286
02:08:31,390 --> 02:08:39,310
Huh? Oh, it's done? So we cleared it? So this is what it's like. This is what it's like for people who never had friends to play multiplayer with.

2287
02:08:39,310 --> 02:08:44,670
Did we? The hug count is 0

2288
02:08:44,670 --> 02:08:49,910
How do you hug? Press Q — press Q and something comes up

2289
02:08:49,910 --> 02:08:53,890
Is it this? Which one is the hug?

2290
02:08:53,890 --> 02:08:58,510
Did you do it? I didn't get one

2291
02:08:58,510 --> 02:09:02,750
I was patting you on the head — you do it too, with Q or something

2292
02:09:02,750 --> 02:09:05,950
How do you do this? Hold Q

2293
02:09:05,950 --> 02:09:09,470
Oh, a high five! High five!

2294
02:09:09,470 --> 02:09:11,490
We got a high five! What about the hug?

2295
02:09:11,490 --> 02:09:15,530
Which one is the hug? The bottom left one?

2296
02:09:15,530 --> 02:09:21,190
What is that?! Scary! That's an attack move! What is this?

2297
02:09:21,190 --> 02:09:24,450
What? Why won't you hug me?

2298
02:09:24,450 --> 02:09:28,080
Fuwaaaan~ You're not going soft on me!

2299
02:09:28,080 --> 02:09:30,610
Is this the hug? Oh! That's a hug!

2300
02:09:30,610 --> 02:09:31,610
Oh, this is the hug, this is it.

2301
02:09:31,610 --> 02:09:33,610
But it still feels like I'm the one initiating it.

2302
02:09:33,610 --> 02:09:34,610
Yeah, you're right.

2303
02:09:34,610 --> 02:09:36,610
Look, I'm taking your head off.

2304
02:09:36,610 --> 02:09:38,370
Stop it~

2305
02:09:38,370 --> 02:09:39,210
I really love this.

2306
02:09:39,210 --> 02:09:43,810
This is my favorite emote.

2307
02:09:43,810 --> 02:09:48,610
So this is the clear screen. Yay!

2308
02:09:48,610 --> 02:09:50,410
We won!

2309
02:09:50,410 --> 02:09:52,240
We lost!

2310
02:09:52,240 --> 02:09:56,010
But let's say we won.

2311
02:09:56,810 --> 02:09:59,810
It's not that we won, it's that we finished, right?

2312
02:09:59,810 --> 02:10:00,810
What was that just now?

2313
02:10:00,810 --> 02:10:02,810
I don't know, I'm just trying everything

2314
02:10:02,810 --> 02:10:04,610
Is this the end?

2315
02:10:04,610 --> 02:10:05,610
Is it really over?

2316
02:10:05,610 --> 02:10:06,610
Apparently it's over

2317
02:10:06,610 --> 02:10:08,610
I didn't think we'd finish today

2318
02:10:08,610 --> 02:10:10,610
I was absolutely sure it wouldn't be today

2319
02:10:10,610 --> 02:10:13,610
I thought there were still like chapters 5, 6, 7, 8, 9 left

2320
02:10:13,610 --> 02:10:15,610
Yeah, same, I thought so too

2321
02:10:15,610 --> 02:10:16,410
We cleared it!

2322
02:10:16,410 --> 02:10:19,210
But yeah, there's no 5, 3, or 6 after all.

2323
02:10:19,210 --> 02:10:20,210
You're right.

2324
02:10:20,210 --> 02:10:21,210
We cleared it!

2325
02:10:21,210 --> 02:10:22,210
We did it, we did it!

2326
02:10:22,210 --> 02:10:23,210
And to think we absolutely couldn't clear it—

2327
02:10:23,210 --> 02:10:31,670
With this, Polka's leveled up again in game skill — what do we do? But hey, your catching was insanely good.

2328
02:10:31,670 --> 02:10:37,470
Portal 2 became twice — it became twice! Wait, twice?

2329
02:10:37,470 --> 02:10:45,550
Oh wow, it's being counted — it said just 2! Wow, and the number of portals placed is almost 2000!

2330
02:10:45,550 --> 02:10:51,150
You were great at portals! You said you're not really good at action games, but—

2331
02:10:51,150 --> 02:10:58,850
Yeah, I feel like I've been playing a ton of Repotore last year, so my action skills went up just a little bit.

2332
02:10:58,850 --> 02:11:02,010
They definitely went up. I bet you could even do Mario now.

2333
02:11:02,010 --> 02:11:05,730
Isn't that a whole different thing though?

2334
02:11:05,730 --> 02:11:08,950
Wait, Mario is different?

2335
02:11:08,950 --> 02:11:09,650
It's different.

2336
02:11:09,650 --> 02:11:11,550
Oh, it's different?

2337
02:11:11,550 --> 02:11:15,870
If you properly watch over me and teach me, I'll play Mario.

2338
02:11:15,870 --> 02:11:20,270
Keep me company then, and I'll do Mario properly too.

2339
02:11:20,270 --> 02:11:24,870
I wanna do Ponpon!

2340
02:11:24,870 --> 02:11:28,650
I wanna do it — I want you to watch!

2341
02:11:28,650 --> 02:11:34,530
A Mario babysitter is pretty rare, you know.

2342
02:11:34,530 --> 02:11:38,350
True, Mario doesn't have any puzzle-solving elements or anything like that.

2343
02:11:38,350 --> 02:11:40,350
Nope.

2344
02:11:40,350 --> 02:11:48,230
And Riona was saying she really wants to play with four people too.

2345
02:11:48,230 --> 02:11:50,890
We should look for games we can play with four people too.

2346
02:11:50,890 --> 02:11:53,290
Four people, huh? Like what?

2347
02:11:53,290 --> 02:11:57,450
Polka was thinking about it, like maybe Mario Party — going full circle and playing that.

2348
02:11:57,450 --> 02:11:59,210
Mario Party?

2349
02:11:59,210 --> 02:12:01,570
You look like you hate that idea. Let's not.

2350
02:12:01,570 --> 02:12:06,910
I wonder if there's something else...

2351
02:12:06,910 --> 02:12:14,150
Right, I wanna do something with four people, and I wanna do oyatsu with four people again, and I wanna hang out with Luna again too.

2352
02:12:14,150 --> 02:12:14,490
Yeah.

2353
02:12:14,490 --> 02:12:16,770
Let's do it, let's do it!

2354
02:12:16,770 --> 02:12:17,990
Let's do it!

2355
02:12:17,990 --> 02:12:20,660
Well, I'm glad it really did end.

2356
02:12:20,660 --> 02:12:22,010
It's over!

2357
02:12:22,010 --> 02:12:23,310
It's done!

2358
02:12:23,310 --> 02:12:29,140
It doesn't feel like an ending at all — we need to make it feel like one.

2359
02:12:29,140 --> 02:12:32,050
Yeah, it ended so smoothly and suddenly.

2360
02:12:32,050 --> 02:12:34,290
Alright then, bye-bye, thanks everyone!

2361
02:12:34,290 --> 02:12:35,290
Portal 2!

2362
02:12:35,290 --> 02:12:39,830
Wow, we played across three sessions — Luna, how was it?

2363
02:12:39,830 --> 02:12:51,740
It was really hard, but when we solved the puzzles together, there was just this... indescribable feeling of accomplishment.

2364
02:12:51,740 --> 02:12:53,210
"Indescribable feeling" — what does that even mean?

2365
02:12:53,210 --> 02:12:57,610
There was definitely that indescribable feeling.

2366
02:12:57,610 --> 02:12:59,890
It was so fun.

2367
02:12:59,890 --> 02:13:01,550
What was your favorite gimmick?

2368
02:13:01,550 --> 02:13:14,030
Hmm, which gimmick... the gel? I forget, it was near the beginning.

2369
02:13:14,030 --> 02:13:17,150
Oh right! But yeah, making infinite loops was the best.

2370
02:13:17,150 --> 02:13:19,490
It was so fun — infinite Ponpon!

2371
02:13:19,490 --> 02:13:21,770
Infinite Ponpon was so fun, wasn't it? It was fun to do too.

2372
02:13:21,770 --> 02:13:25,810
We ended up doing infinite Ponpon today too, one way or another.

2373
02:13:25,810 --> 02:13:28,230
Everything came together at the end — the funnels and all that.

2374
02:13:28,230 --> 02:13:32,030
Yeah. Taking down turrets is quietly satisfying.

2375
02:13:32,030 --> 02:13:37,830
Right, today we worked hard to take down the Pope — I mean the boss. And we took down turrets today too, that was great.

2376
02:13:37,830 --> 02:13:41,430
Yeah. I was jumping around trying my best.

2377
02:13:41,430 --> 02:13:45,230
Those two buttons in the corners... oh, is this it?

2378
02:13:45,230 --> 02:13:49,080
What? How? Apparently there's downloadable content.

2379
02:13:49,080 --> 02:13:54,080
Well, it's probably super long so we won't play it, but it says to press these two buttons in the corners — but how do we...

2380
02:13:54,080 --> 02:13:56,880
How do we do it?

2381
02:13:56,880 --> 02:13:58,880
The puzzle-solving has started again.

2382
02:13:58,880 --> 02:14:01,880
The puzzle-solving never ends.

2383
02:14:01,880 --> 02:14:03,880
Puzzle-solving time has begun!

2384
02:14:03,880 --> 02:14:05,880
You can shoot over there!

2385
02:14:05,880 --> 02:14:07,480
Is that how it works?

2386
02:14:07,480 --> 02:14:09,480
You connect it to somewhere, right?

2387
02:14:09,480 --> 02:14:11,280
Connected!

2388
02:14:11,280 --> 02:14:13,280
We can press it!

2389
02:14:20,620 --> 02:14:23,240
If there's like 5 more hours of this, we're not doing it today.

2390
02:14:23,240 --> 02:14:27,260
There's still more — this thing called DLC.

2391
02:14:27,260 --> 02:14:32,640
Is the extra course after the main course?

2392
02:14:32,640 --> 02:14:35,520
So that was all just practice after all.

2393
02:14:35,520 --> 02:14:37,740
Wait, everything up until now?

2394
02:14:37,740 --> 02:14:39,980
So there really is a real final stage?

2395
02:14:39,980 --> 02:14:41,800
Art Therapy.

2396
02:14:41,800 --> 02:14:42,680
That's way too long.

2397
02:14:42,680 --> 02:14:44,660
What are you talking about, "Art Therapy"?

2398
02:14:44,660 --> 02:14:46,960
What is this, Xenoblade?

2399
02:14:46,960 --> 02:14:49,320
Wait, there's a ton of stuff here!

2400
02:14:49,880 --> 02:14:55,120
Is this how you use it? There are already 16 co-op ones here.

2401
02:14:55,120 --> 02:15:05,570
I don't think it's part of the main course — these are probably both for two players. Wait, wasn't the last one Course 5? So this is Course 6?

2402
02:15:05,570 --> 02:15:13,460
Oh, so this is a continuation. Let me peek... so this is the DLC? Got it!

2403
02:15:13,460 --> 02:15:15,260
What on earth is going on?!

2404
02:15:15,260 --> 02:15:18,260
Nobody told me about this! I thought it was over!

2405
02:15:18,260 --> 02:15:24,220
So Chapter 5 was the ending, but DLC added Chapters 6 and beyond?

2406
02:15:24,220 --> 02:15:25,860
6, 7, 8, 9?!

2407
02:15:25,860 --> 02:15:27,860
Are you really gonna give me therapy after this?

2408
02:15:27,860 --> 02:15:29,860
There's so much more!

2409
02:15:29,860 --> 02:15:31,860
Welcome to the future.

2410
02:15:31,860 --> 02:15:33,860
So this is the real deal now?

2411
02:15:33,860 --> 02:15:35,860
Assembled for testing over 100,000 years...

2412
02:15:35,860 --> 02:15:37,660
What do you mean, the real deal?

2413
02:15:37,660 --> 02:15:39,660
Huh?

2414
02:15:39,660 --> 02:15:43,460
Oh, everyone's safe — the humans!

2415
02:15:43,460 --> 02:15:45,460
The humans are alive, aren't they?

2416
02:15:45,460 --> 02:15:49,260
Wait, it became... artistic entertainment?

2417
02:15:49,260 --> 02:15:51,060
Oh.

2418
02:15:51,060 --> 02:15:56,460
There we go.

2419
02:15:56,460 --> 02:15:59,460
Wait, why? Why is this happening?

2420
02:15:59,460 --> 02:16:02,460
Whoa!

2421
02:16:02,460 --> 02:16:05,460
Luna? Luna? Luna?

2422
02:16:05,460 --> 02:16:07,460
You're on the other side.

2423
02:16:07,460 --> 02:16:12,100
It's started — this feels super nostalgic!

2424
02:16:12,100 --> 02:16:15,000
Didn't the rooms split up like this at the very beginning?

2425
02:16:15,000 --> 02:16:17,720
It was just like this! This is totally the first stage vibes.

2426
02:16:17,720 --> 02:16:20,660
The platforms — I remember these!

2427
02:16:20,660 --> 02:16:25,080
So nostalgic. We had no idea what we were doing. Brings back memories of the early sessions.

2428
02:16:25,080 --> 02:16:31,360
It was like this at the start — we had no clue what to do and I thought we'd end right here.

2429
02:16:31,360 --> 02:16:34,960
Something's falling from above here.

2430
02:16:36,800 --> 02:16:39,680
We'll fry the turrets with this!

2431
02:16:39,680 --> 02:16:42,600
Fry them! Watch — fry!

2432
02:16:42,600 --> 02:16:44,400
Oh wait, sorry — it just comes straight through, huh.

2433
02:16:44,400 --> 02:16:46,200
Oh, so it gets fried by this too.

2434
02:16:46,200 --> 02:16:47,200
Here you go.

2435
02:16:47,200 --> 02:16:49,000
Whoa~!

2436
02:16:49,000 --> 02:16:52,000
Oh~!

2437
02:16:52,000 --> 02:16:53,600
Huh?

2438
02:16:53,600 --> 02:16:57,600
Oh wait, I have to place it close by.

2439
02:16:57,600 --> 02:16:59,400
Okay. Anything else?

2440
02:16:59,400 --> 02:17:01,400
Wait, is this similar to what we did at the beginning?

2441
02:17:01,400 --> 02:17:03,400
It's super similar, right?!

2442
02:17:03,400 --> 02:17:06,400
I feel like it was kinda like this, yeah.

2443
02:17:06,400 --> 02:17:09,200
Ow ow ow ow ow ow ow!

2444
02:17:09,200 --> 02:17:11,000
Pol-Pol is getting shot!

2445
02:17:11,000 --> 02:17:13,800
Huh? What's this?

2446
02:17:13,800 --> 02:17:17,350
It's kinda similar.

2447
02:17:17,350 --> 02:17:21,350
There were no turrets before — is this like a hard mode version?

2448
02:17:21,350 --> 02:17:23,150
It got a bit harder.

2449
02:17:23,150 --> 02:17:25,820
Is that what this is?

2450
02:17:25,820 --> 02:17:27,550
Maybe?

2451
02:17:27,550 --> 02:17:43,350
The ending already changed earlier, so this is where it ends... No no no! Argh! Pol-Pol got destroyed! Good work! I'm done with Portal! That's it!

2452
02:17:43,350 --> 02:17:47,350
So Polka had fun too. What was your favorite mechanic? Infinite Pon-Pon!

2453
02:17:47,350 --> 02:17:52,150
Infinite Pon-Pon~!

2454
02:17:52,150 --> 02:17:58,470
If we get the chance, we could do the DLC next time, but for now let's call it here.

2455
02:17:58,470 --> 02:18:03,770
I'll forgive you. Portal — complete!

2456
02:18:03,770 --> 02:18:06,350
I want to hug you, but I can't.

2457
02:18:06,350 --> 02:18:10,130
We're separated by a window.

2458
02:18:10,130 --> 02:18:14,990
See you next time on Poruna!

2459
02:18:14,990 --> 02:18:16,470
Okay, all together now—

2460
02:18:16,470 --> 02:18:18,530
Otsu-Poruna~!

2461
02:18:18,530 --> 02:18:20,390
Otsu-Poruna~!

2462
02:18:20,390 --> 02:18:28,580
Otsu-Poruna~!
